	(text "J?: K-type TC input. Options:\n - Mini K-type socket (yellow, Omega PCC-SMP-K style)\n - or 2-pin Nano-Fit if the harness lead prefers\nLabel pins TC+ (yellow tape lead) / TC-.\nCopper between connector and ADC = cold junction;\nkeep both TC traces symmetric."
